@valodzka could you test with latest 4.0 branch: 

This test works for me:

```

    @Test
    public void testToStringComposite() {
        CompositeByteBuf cBuff = compositeBuffer();
        cBuff.addComponent(buffer(8).writeLong(0));
        cBuff.addComponent(buffer(8).writeLong(0));

        // work as expected
        System.err.println("str="+ cBuff.toString(0, 16, CharsetUtil.UTF_8));
        // fails
        System.err.println("str="+ cBuff.toString(3, 13, CharsetUtil.UTF_8));
    }
